  "_technicalComment": "Writing code AS THE JOB. Technical literacy is never counted here: HTML, CSS, templates, spreadsheets, Jira and CMSs are her daily tools and are deliberately absent from this list — which is what makes ONE hit enough. Every phrase below is decisive on its own, and half the sources return only a snippet, so requiring two found nothing at all: 122 of 126 published postings contained none of these and the four that did contained exactly one.",
